869 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 629 0 R
/E (        For our layouting, meaning the typesetting of the display, accent, and body fonts, we are to take some notes from the editorial design inspirations and keep the identifying elements in their consistent place. The logotype is to stay in the upper-left side of the layout when the header is at the bottom, and vice-versa, at the bottom-right, when the header is at the top. The handle is always at the opposite end of the logotype. This is to maximize brand recognition and ensure that our pubmats stay consistent with the branding. The template for these are linked in their examples.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
