/Title (The five pastel colors that 1DOLO had been synonymous with had undergone changes in the last two years and it is once again going through one. These color tweaks all have been meticulously picked apart and built back up to ensure the best combinations of hues while still keeping the roots of our block. The two main colors, green and red, had been moved to the secondary category to remedy the problem of the fact that there would otherwise be no swatch to contrast the rest of the primary palette. This does not necessarily mean they would be used less, we just needed to prioritize a white and black color. We cannot use pure white #FFFFFF or pure black #00000 as that would make our design bland and sterile, except some cases.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3594 0 R
/Next 3636 0 R
>>
